an't be designated, though they may supply pricing services.\n\n**Required reporting to the board:**\n- The valuation designee must provide written assessments of the fund's valuation approaches and fair value determinations at least quarterly.\n- It must report promptly on significant valuation matters, such as material valuation issues or significant deficiencies or material weaknesses in the valuation process.\n- The board must review the designee's fair value determinations and assessments at least quarterly, and must oversee and evaluate the designee's processes.\n- The fund must keep records of these determinations and reports under Rule 31a-1.","ttft_ms":5918,"type":"result","duration_ms":7022,"uuid":"8550a684-92d1-400d-95da-79957497020d","ttft_stream_ms":853,"time_to_request_ms":90,"first_content_frame_ms":853,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
